{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36457","headline":"长安春夕旅怀 · 罗邺","name":"长安春夕旅怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"几年栖旅寄西秦，不识花枝醉过春。\n短艇闲思五湖浪，羸蹄愁伴九衢尘。\n关河风雨迷归梦，钟鼓朝昏老此身。\n忽向太平时节过，一竿持去老遗民。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗邺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36457.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36457","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}